@startuml Create_Board_Use_Case
title Use Case 5.1  Create Board

actor User
participant BoardsView as View
participant "CreateBoard\nController" as Controller
participant "CreateBoard\nInputBoundary" as Input
participant "CreateBoard\nInteractor" as Interactor
participant "BoardData\nAccessInterface" as DAO
participant "CreateBoard\nOutputBoundary" as Output
participant BoardFactory as Factory

User -> View : Enter name and click Create
View -> Controller : 1: execute(currentUserId, name)
Controller -> Input : 1.1: execute(inputData)
Input --> Interactor : 1.1.1: execute(inputData)

Interactor -> DAO : 1.1.1.1: existsByName(userId, name)
DAO --> Interactor : false

Interactor -> Factory : 1.1.1.2: create(userId, name)
Factory --> Interactor : board

Interactor -> DAO : 1.1.1.3: save(board)
DAO --> Interactor

Interactor -> Output : 1.1.1.4: prepareSuccessView(outputData)
Output --> Interactor

Interactor --> Input
Input --> Controller
Controller --> View
View --> User : Display new board
@enduml
